    umlmeta:oclConstraint "Value for the client metaproperty must be stereotyped «ArchitecturalDescription» or its specializations." ;
    umlmeta:oclConstraint "Value for the supplier metaproperty must be stereotyped «ArchitecturalDescription» or its specializations." .

