    umlmeta:oclConstraint "In case of ResourceExchange.exchangeKind: = ResourceCommunication, the conveyed element must be stereotyped «DataElement» or its specializations, = ResourceMovement, the conveyed element must be stereotyped by the specialization of «PhysicalResource», = ResourceEnergyFlow, the conveyed element must be stereotyped «NaturalResource» or its specializations, = GeoPoliticalExtentExchange, the conveyed element must be stereotyped «GeoPoliticalExtentType» or its specializations." ;
    umlmeta:oclConstraint "Value for the realizingActivityEdge metaproperty must be stereotyped by the specialization of «FunctionEdge»." ;
    umlmeta:oclConstraint "Value for the realizingConnector metaproperty must be stereotyped «ResourceConnector» or its specializations." ;
    umlmeta:oclConstraint "Value for the informationSource metaproperty must be stereotyped by the specialization of «ResourcePerformer»." ;
    umlmeta:oclConstraint "Value for the informationTarget metaproperty must be stereotyped by the specialization of «ResourcePerformer»." ;
    umlmeta:oclConstraint "Value for the realizingMessage metaproperty must be stereotyped «ResourceMessage» or its specializations." .

