    umlmeta:oclConstraint "In case of value for PerformsInContext.client is stereotyped: a. «OperationalRole» or its specializations, values for the supplier metaproperty must be stereotyped «OperationalActivityAction» or its specializations, b. «ServiceRole» or its specializations, values for the supplier metaproperty must be stereotyped «ServiceFunctionAction» or its specializations, c. «ResourceRole» or its specializations, values for the supplier metaproperty must be stereotyped «FunctionAction» or its specializations." .

